\usepackage{amsfonts}
\usepackage{amssymb}
\usepackage{amsbsy}
\usepackage{upgreek}
\usepackage{mathrsfs}
\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
\begin{document}
$[29.04, 269.09]$\end{document}, and account for 60% of all peaks in the spectra in our dataset (Fig. 2a). By restricting spectra to these 1,000 bins, 94% of the compounds in the dataset still have 3 or more peaks, 90% have 5 or more, and 80% have 10 or more (Fig. 2b).

