We ensured that each molecule in the dataset had its exact mass, verifying that it matched the mass calculated from its SMILES within a 0.01 difference. Only one molecule did not match, so we eliminated it to avoid inconsistencies. We also verified that each spectrum contained the m/z of the precursor ion corresponding to the [M+H] adduct, allowing a window of \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
